{"translation-revision-date":"2025-07-07 12:25:05+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.0.3","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=1; plural=0;","lang":"vi_VN"},"Ouch, there was a glitch. Try activating V4 again soon.":["R\u1ea5t ti\u1ebfc, \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 l\u1ed7i x\u1ea3y ra. H\u00e3y th\u1eed k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t l\u1ea1i V4 s\u1edbm."],"You\u2019ve deactivated the new Editor. Have feedback?":["B\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ee7y k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t Tr\u00ecnh ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda m\u1edbi. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i kh\u00f4ng?"],"Welcome! You\u2019ve got the newest version of the editor.":["Ch\u00e0o m\u1eebng! B\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a tr\u00ecnh ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda."],"Activate the new experience":["K\u00edch ho\u1ea1t tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m m\u1edbi"],"Try out the new experience":["D\u00f9ng th\u1eed tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m m\u1edbi"],"Tell us why":["Cho ch\u00fang t\u00f4i bi\u1ebft l\u00fd do"],"Head over to Github":["Truy c\u1eadp Github"],"We\u2019d love your feedback!":["Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i r\u1ea5t mong nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n!"],"And much more!":["V\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n n\u1eefa!"],"Fully responsive design - Customize any style property per screen.":["Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n - T\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 thu\u1ed9c t\u00ednh ki\u1ec3u n\u00e0o cho m\u1ed7i m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh."],"Deactivate V4":["H\u1ee7y k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t V4"]," Important notes:":[" L\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng:"],"By activating, you\u2019ll get early access to the next generation of Elementor\u2019s Editor. This is your chance to explore new capabilities and help shape the future of Elementor! ":["B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u00f3 quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp s\u1edbm v\u00e0o th\u1ebf h\u1ec7 ti\u1ebfp theo c\u1ee7a Tr\u00ecnh ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda Elementor. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 c\u00e1c kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng m\u1edbi v\u00e0 gi\u00fap \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u00ecnh t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai c\u1ee7a Elementor! "],"I\u2019ve read and understood.":["T\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ecdc v\u00e0 hi\u1ec3u."],"Deactivate":["D\u1eebng k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t"],"Editor V4":["Tr\u00ecnh ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda V4"],"Activate":["K\u00edch ho\u1ea1t"],"Learn more":["T\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u th\u00eam"],"Beta":["Th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m"],"Cancel":["H\u1ee7y b\u1ecf"]}},"comment":{"reference":"assets\/js\/editor-v4-opt-in.js"}}